                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Combs to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-06-19"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">June 19, 1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your instructions, June 15, will be carried out to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Combs.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
